window.products.push({"id":445083,"name":"Hanging Magnet Frame by Canetti-11x14 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DDOCp5hEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Hanging Frame by Canetti is made of two panels of clear, solid acrylic, which are held together by tiny magnet points. The picture is very easily placed between the two panels and is held securely with no additional hardware. The frame has a keyhole on the back and can hang on the wall either horizontally or vertically on a nail or screw. Once mounted, you only have to remove the front panel to replace your photo. The large sizes allow you to display your most important moments or memorabilia.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DDOCp5hEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Canetti","source_asin":"B07GWH16T6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445083","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GWH16T6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GWH16T6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":445084,"name":"Umbra Touch Collection, Ocean Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cBKZkJ5CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Most of us keep our toothbrushes and toothpaste easily accessible, and although what we choose to keep them in might be practical, It's often not so stylish. Upgrade the look of your toothbrush holder/organizer with this modern and attractive piece from Umbra. Introducing the Touch Toothbrush Holder by Umbra Touch Toothbrush holder has three compartments; a large one for bulkier items like toothpaste, and two smaller compartments for regular-sized toothbrushes. Having separated holders will help keep your toothbrushes organized, and you will be less likely to mix up your toothbrush with someone else'sin a shared washroom. Details Touch is made of a matte, soft-touch molded material, which is easy to clean, and highly durable. The finish is both luxurious and pleasing to the eye. Compact, it will take up minimal counterspace, measuring 3 ½ x 3 x 4 inches (8. 9 x 7. 6 x 10. 2 cm). Touch is part of a wider collection of bath products, all designed by Alan Wisniewski, its molded material makes it low-risk for breakage. Other pieces in this collection include a waste can, soap pump, soap dish, and a toilet brush holder. The Touch Collection comes in your choice of white, grey and black. For a neat, eye-catching toothbrush holder that will help keep you organized, order the Touch Toothbrush Holder today. About Umbra: A global product design company providing original, modern, casual, functional, and affordable design for the home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cBKZkJ5CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Umbra","source_asin":"B084488356","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445084","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084488356","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084488356","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
