window.products.push({"id":445215,"name":"Xingjiake 12-piece Bright Silver Steak Knives, Steak Knives Set Of 12, Stainless Steel Dinner Knives Set, Steak Knife Set, Serrated Butter Knife, Dish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nV6CRMd4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Material: This dinner knives are made using high-quality thickening material - Preferred 18-0 stainless steel, long lasting and highly corrosion resistant, more durable. Unique Design: Integrated stamping molding, not easy to aging, ergonomic design, comfortable grip Sharp Teeth-Circular arc design, uniform and clear sawtooth, powerful cutting. Mirror Polishing Process-Each tableware needs manual polishing, from thick to thin layers of polishing, until the final shiny mirror effect. Multiple colour optional: This steak knives set of 12, Various colors are available to meet your different matching requirements and make your life better. SAFETY: This stainless steel dinner knives ergonomic design and smooth finish ensured safety from injuring yourself accidentally. Steps for tableware washing 1. Use hot water at 45℃; 2. Add dishwashing detergent; 3. Put the tableware into the water and soak for 1-2 minutes; 4. Carefully wash the surface of cutlery; 5. Check the cleanliness of tableware, unclean can be further washed; 6. Remove residual detergent on tableware. After washing, put clean water into tableware, and it is best to use running water to remove residual detergent on tableware. Cleaning precautions: Please use clean water or neutral detergent to clean tableware, do not use strong acid or alkaline detergent.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nV6CRMd4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xingjiake","source_asin":"B09L71BY35","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445215","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L71BY35","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L71BY35","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
