window.products.push({"id":445263,"name":"OTHWAY No Suction Cup Bath Mat: 39x16inch Extra Long Bathmat│Perfect for Refinished Bathtub Mat│Made of Nature Rubber│a Blessing for The Elderly and C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rQBAhpI5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【No Suction Cup Bathmat】If you just had your bathtub refinished, you must needed a bathtub mat that would insure the finish would last. The material is sturdy and safe and the reverse suction cups will ensure the refinished tub stays looking new. 【Excellent Grip】You will be very impressed with the holding power and non-slip grip. Before fill with water in the tub, press the mat’s reversed suction rings and putting pressure on them increases grip–It helps prevent slipping & sliding. 【NOT for textured tubs】 【Easy to Clean】No worry about the suction cups leaving rings on the bathtub. It can be picked up to clean easily, this is a blessing for the elderly or someone with back problems. You just need to pick up after every use, rinse and hang on side of tub to dry. 【Ideal Size for Larger Tub】This 39 by 16 Inch and 2.55 pounds extra long bath mat can perfect covers your whole standard tub. Larger than most non slip mat on the market. U shape design is convenience for the water drain. 【Nature Rubber Material】The bathtub mat is real rubber made, with NO toxic PVC vinyl, our recyclable mats are washable in warm water. Great for family use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rQBAhpI5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OTHWAY","source_asin":"B0B6FGZC4H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6FGZC4H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6FGZC4H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":445264,"name":"6 Pack Corkscrew Wine Opener With Foil Cutter By YWQ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tQHXTKVYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Durable Wine Opener for Travel Bought this set for traveling as I like to have wine when traveling and not all hotels have wine openers available. This is a great set for the value as I received wine openers. They fold up, and is an all-in-one type deal in which you can cut the foil and uncork the wine as well. I do not recommend taking this wine opener in your carry on bag, only if you are going to have check-in luggage that this would work for. The set feels heavy and weighs much more than the generic one I purchased from a drugstore (see picture) and is much more compact for traveling. It can also be used as a bottle opener, which is very handy for traveling as well. Because it came in a set of 6, I actually have put one in my home as well as one in my cooler for travel as well. Overall, I am very happy with the item and the value I paid for it. This works great, and functions just as expected. The Perfect Corkscrew This is the type of wine bottle opener used by professional wine stewards and sommeliers everywhere. Simple design, easiest/quickest to use - twist the corkscrew in cork, lower blank end of handle slightly down so that the notch on metal lever closest to the handle fits on bottle opening (top of bottle mouth). Then, simply lift up on the handle all the way, release the notch from bottle a fit the lower notch on the bottle and continue lifting handle to remove cork. This particular unit has a thick corkscrew with wise turns requiring fewer twists to fully insert into cork. The foil-cutting blade is aggressively serrated to ensure to ensure fully cut foil with a simple and confident single swipe. This the BEST waiter corkscrew I have ever used at this price!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tQHXTKVYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YWQ","source_asin":"B07F6B48G4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445264","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F6B48G4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F6B48G4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
