window.products.push({"id":445322,"name":"Retro Kerosene Lamp, Emergency Large Capacity Barn Lantern, Light Decoration Bronze Ornament for Pub Inn Outdoor Light Home Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617u5BEU36L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"[High reuse rate] This vintage lamp can be used repeatedly, it can be easily stored when not in use, it is a stunning decoration in any corner of your home, with a long service life, you do not have to worry about the frequent need to replace it. [Multi-functional easy installation] This kerosene lamp is environmentally friendly and energy saving easy to install, just add kerosene and light it to use, you can put it on the table for lighting or carry it out to use. [Practical and strong] This vintage barn light is exquisite and dignified in appearance, practical and strong, it can be used as a small home decoration ornament to decorate the room, you can put it on the table top or wine cooler in the living room, or use it for lighting. [clever design] This decorative kerosene lamp is made of advanced metal structure with high strength and vintage style, enhancing your taste while reminding you of the past years. [Durable] This decorative kerosene lamp has a large tank capacity, high quality wick, high brightness and good lighting effect, which is a very practical lighting device.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617u5BEU36L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zunate","source_asin":"B09TZGRY9V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TZGRY9V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TZGRY9V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":445323,"name":"Homesick Scented Candle, 13.75 oz, North Carolina","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6183gQZDxSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Founded in 2016, Homesick creates authentic, hand-poured products that draw on the power of scent to evoke treasured memories of people, places, and memories. Each fragrance is extensively researched and developed by our team of storytellers, perfume chemists, and chandlers in collaboration with passion communities. Made from a natural soy wax blend with premium cotton wicks and custom fragrance oils, our candles are non toxic, contain no lead, plastics, parabens or phthalates and are hand poured in small batches in Massachusetts. From the Manufacturer Bring home to you, no matter where you are Using input from locals in various states, we crafted scents that embody those places and bring us back home. Homesick’s hand-poured candles began as a hobby in our kitchen, and to this day we still create each unique candle by hand, one by one. States, Cities, Countries and Memories Whether it’s the seabreezes of Southern California, the distinctive scents of spring days in Central Park in NYC or the vibrance of the energy that pulses through Brasil we have you covered. Books Scent: The main theme is an older leather bound book accord mixed with a woody desk character of cedar and sandalwood. Hints of balsamic and vanilla finish the complex scent. Grandmas Kitchen Table Scent: The scents of rich butter mixed with touches of apple, cinnamon, clove and a hint of sugar cookie. Tonka bean and sugar finish out this homey aroma. Summer Camp Scent: Fresh green grass accord with hints of crystal clear lake water, blooming hyacinth found along trails and just a touch of fresh lemon and smoke. Take Me Home Scent is the strongest tie to memory. Inhaling those sweet aromas while your mind immediately travesl back to those carefree days or amazing experienes. Home can mean so many things and it can be in so many places. Homesick Candles allows you bring bring all of those memories with you, no matter where you go! From your childhood state, to the city where you got engaged, to the best vacation ever in Hawaii to that epic Road Trip with your friends. We have a custom scent for all US States, iconic cities, vibrant countries and those memorable experiences. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Nostalgic, Memories, All-Natural How did you come up with the idea for this product? We were living in NYC and yet all of us were from somewhere else and missing home. In the winter of 2016, we sought out to find a way to keep that place with you, no matter where you live. Homesick’s hand-poured candles began as a hobby in our kitchen, and to this day we still create each unique candle by hand, one by one. Using input from locals in various states, we crafted scents that embody those places and bring us back home. keep that place with you, no matter where you live. What makes your product special? We finely craft custom scents that are tied to places and memories. Nostalgia in the warmth of a candle. What has been the best part of your startup experience? Collaborating with other small businesses and local input. We feel like we've taken a road trip thru the entire USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6183gQZDxSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homesick","source_asin":"B06XGJGB9W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XGJGB9W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XGJGB9W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
