window.products.push({"id":445327,"name":"Zeemplify Premium Firewood Log Carrier (Canvas 18oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D6uvUIuTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HAVE YOU EXPERIENCED IT? There are only so many hours in a day for you to do everything that you need to do in your daily life. It can be frustrating when something as simple as carrying and moving things like firewood from one place to another ends up taking too much time or causing more mess. This is especially true when you have to move a pile of wood with just your hands and arms. It is just a struggle to haul everything easily, quickly and safely… THANKFULLY THERE IS A SOLUTION! The Collector has been designed with you in mind. Carry things the smart and efficient way with this heavy-duty canvas log carrier! Constructed with a thick and durable 18oz canvas material to ensure that it WILL NOT TEAR OR BREAK when you are lifting a heavy load, this large capacity wood tote will enable you to carry much more, thereby saving you time, and clothes. SATISFIED? We are so confident that you’ll love The Collector that we offer a LIFETIME MONEY BACK GUARANTEE. ONE CARRIER TO RULE THEM ALL Designed with high enclosed ends, this firewood carrier will ensure that nothing falls out of the bag. So say goodbye to all the mess from the dirt, bark and wood bits, because this tote has been created to be the best carrier in the market. And, when you are not using The Collector as a firewood log carrier, try using it as a beach tote, reusable shopping bag or even a carrying bag for all your tools at home! Avoid the choice altogether, and just buy two! For a limited time, get our FREE BONUS GUIDEBOOK – ‘The Ultimate Guide On Firewood’. It’ll teach you everything! SO CLICK THE ‘ADD TO CART’ BUTTON NOW, AND CARRY MORE WITHOUT THE MESS TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D6uvUIuTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zeemplify","source_asin":"B00S9NP2OY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445327","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00S9NP2OY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00S9NP2OY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
