window.products.push({"id":445365,"name":"DDS-DUDES 4Pcs Nightmare Before Christmas Zombie Bride Jack Shower Curtain Sets Kids Bathroom Halloween Decor with 12 Curtain Hooks for Bathroom, Wate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eot6DZrIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Package including】1Pcs shower curtain + 1Pcs rectangle mat + 1Pcs u shape mat + 1PC toilet lid cover mat + 12Pcs hooks. The shower curtain measures 71 x 71inch, which can completely cover a normal bathtub. Suitable for most standard size bathtubs and showers.We use a vacuum-packed shower curtain set, the cushion will look thin when unpacked, and it can be wetted with water to restore the thickness immediately or leave it for 2-3 days to restore the normal thickness. 【Unique Material】The shower curtain is made of high-quality polyester fabric, odorless, and has a good and unique appearance. It is thicker than ordinary fabrics and feels more comfortable. It will not stick to the body during the shower and can be reused for a long time. 【Good Water Resistance】Our shower curtain is waterproof and helps keep water in the bathroom. After showering, you can rinse or wipe to clean the shower curtain. After water sliding, it dries quickly and will not fade after long-term use. The shower curtain can be used alone or together with the shower curtain lining. 【Artistic Shower Curtain】Adopt advanced high-definition digital printing to make the shower curtain with clear patterns and bright colors. Suitable for various types of bathroom decoration style, providing a beautiful sense of fashion decoration and home furnishing The warm feeling. 【Easy to Install】We offer you 12 hooks for free. You don't have to worry about how to install it. Just hang it on the top of the edge. You can use this shower curtain set to decorate your bathroom, living room, bedroom and any space you like. It's also a wonderful gift for family, friends, coworkers, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eot6DZrIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DDS-DUDES","source_asin":"B0BYJ4M7CS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYJ4M7CS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYJ4M7CS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":445366,"name":"400 Thread Count Bed Sheet Sets - Luxurious 100% Egyptian Cotton Deep Pocket Sheets - Bedding Set Includes One Flat Sheet, Two Fitted Sheets & Two Pil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QIebX4yGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Our 100% Egyptian Cotton 400 Thread Count Sheet Sets are the perfect product for anyone looking for ultra-soft sheets that still maintain the durability and quality of high thread count luxury linens. These sheets will literally become softer and softer with every wash, so there is no limit to the amount of comfort that they will provide. They're available in multiple size ranges and colors making up almost 200 options! Egyptian Cotton: Why is Egyptian cotton so much better for your sheets? Quite simply, Egyptian cotton produces longer fibers (up to twice as long as a standard cotton fiber). The longer fibers or staples are easily spun into finer count yarns, and turned into the softest sheets you will ever sleep on. Single Ply: \"Ply\" refers to the number of yarns wrapped together in a single thread. The process of plying creates thicker threads, which will impact a sheet's feel and durability. Finer threads allow for higher thread counts and a softer sheet with an elegant drape.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QIebX4yGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ExceptionalSheets","source_asin":"B008I3XMVK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008I3XMVK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008I3XMVK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":445367,"name":"najiaxiaowu 8 Packs Underwear Drawer Organizer,Underwear and Bras Drawer Organizers for Clothing with 90 Cells Fabric Foldable Grids Dividers Box for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fLdqi9nAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【90 Compartments Storage Volume】The 8 pieces storage box with 90 cells can easily store all underwear socks of 4-6 people! 24 cells*2 storage box can accommodate 48 pairs of socks at least,such as stockings, socks, cotton socks, women's silk socks, etc. 7 cells*2 are specially used to store the women's bras to keep bras firm and the bras will not be compressed and deformed. 6 cells *2 can store underpants and baby clothes. 8 cells*2 can be used for storing men's ties! 【Make Your Life Easier】Put one piece of underwear on each grid to let every underwear have a home! With it, your wardrobe and drawers will not be in a mess again! This will greatly reduce the time of looking for underwear.Now please enjoy the convenience and beauty of life brought by neat storage! 【Sturdy and Durable】The advanced non-woven material makes the storage box very durable, so you can use it for a long time! The 3.0mm PP board configured at the bottom and around can make the storage box very three-dimensional and not collapse, which can well maintain the shape of the clothes and not have many wrinkles!The bottom fabric has breathable mesh to keep the air flowing! 【Multi-function to Use】Very suitable for storing in the wardrobe, drawer, bedside table and dresser to keep the family clean and reduce clutter.And the interior cell is deepened to accommodate up to 2 packs of cotton socks, which greatly increases the capacity! 【Easy to Install and Foldable】Each storage box has a bevel zipper at the bottom. You just need to close the zipper to get a storage box. And if you are not using it, it can also be folded in half to save space. 12 hour online customer service. If you have any questions, please contact us and wewill solve them for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fLdqi9nAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"najiaxiaowu","source_asin":"B0C6SQ4TWP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6SQ4TWP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6SQ4TWP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
