window.products.push({"id":445390,"name":"PAMI Deli Plastic Containers With Lids [48-Pack, 8oz] - Small Food Containers For Sauces, Salsas, Dips - BPA-Free, Microwave & Freezer Safe Food Stora","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61n+Xyh3tWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE HANDIEST 100% LEAKPROOF DELI CONTAINERS WITH LIDS: The PAMI deli food storage containers with lids are the perfect little pots for sauces, dips, salsas, shredded cheese, broths, condiments, spreads, salad dressings, soups and so much more. Completely leakproof and with sturdy lids for secure closure, these deli containers will make storing any ingredient a breeze. Great for your lunch box too! MICROWAVE & FREEZER SAFE FOR AN ARRAY OF USES: Our small meal prep containers are microwave safe so you can effortlessly enjoy a perfectly warm and delicious meal without any ifs and buts. [Do not microwave with lids.] They are also fridge and freezer safe, allowing you to prepare any meal in advance. Suitable for hot and cold uses. [Available in 4sizes: 8oz - 48 count, 16oz - 48 count, 24oz - 24 count & 32oz - 24 count] STACKABLE, DISHWASHER SAFE & REUSABLE FOR YOUR CONVENIENCE: These reusable small round food containers are stackable so you can easily store them in the pantry, fridge or freezer without occupying much space. And the best part? They are dishwasher safe for hassle-free cleaning. They even come in a resealable plastic bag to remain clean and dust-free until use. BPA-FREE QUALITY FOR SAFE USE & UNBEATABLY VERSATILE: Made of the highest quality plastic materials, our BPA-free deli containers are equal parts practical and safe. Use them to take any sauce/dip/salsa/dressing with you and enjoy a perfectly tasty meal at the office, uni or on-the-go. They can also be used to pack your daily healthy snacks, including nuts and dried fruit. Ideal even to organize those little things around your home, including nails, arts and crafts supplies and jewelry. ·       BACKED UP BY PAMI’S SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Focused on creating the highest quality disposable dinnerware, catering and party supplies, each PAMI product is backed up by an Unconditional 30-Day Money-Back Satisfaction Guarantee. With nothing to worry about, you can order yours for your home or your food business today, completely risk-free!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61n+Xyh3tWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PAMI","source_asin":"B0BK786Z97","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445390","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK786Z97","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK786Z97","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
