window.products.push({"id":445450,"name":"Anolon Advanced Hard Anodized Nonstick Sauce Pan/Saucepan with Lid, 2 Quart, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Za8NlZhkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Make everything from a savory herbed quinoa side dish to homemade macaroni and havarti cheese with the versatile Anolon Advanced Hard-Anodized Nonstick 2-Quart Saucepan with Lid. Designed with heavy-duty, hard-anodized construction to provide even heat distribution for exceptional cooking performance, the saucepan features durable nonstick surface inside and out ideal for easy cleanup. PFOA-free premium-quality nonstick is metal utensil safe and it delivers superior durability, and the saucepan’s revolutionary rubberized stainless steel Anolon SureGrip(r) handle provides a confident yet soft grasp when pouring noodles into a colander or a sauce into a serving dish. The comfortable saucepan handle is also dual riveted for extra strength and oven safe to 400°F. A break-resistant domed glass lid allows foods like brown rice to be monitored while cooking without losing heat or moisture, and this saucepan makes the perfect beginning for or addition to a home chef’s complete Anolon Advanced collection. Prepare favorite dishes with professional-level performance and locally sourced ingredients in the Anolon Advanced Hard-Anodized Nonstick 2-Quart Saucepan with Lid. Amazon.com Coated inside and out with Dupont's exceptionally durable, three-layer Autograph nonstick, Anolon Advanced cookware provides heavyweight, professional-quality performance and 21st-century convenience. Pots and pans clean easily, while the rugged nonstick readily releases food. Beneath the nonstick is heavy-gauge, harder-than-steel anodized aluminum. Pot and pan bottoms are left uncoated to conduct heat quickly and prevent hot spots. Bright chrome handles have hanging holes for storage and soft, stay-cool rubber grips for slip-resistance. Break-resistant, domed glass lids permit cooking to be monitored without releasing heat and are oven-safe to 375 F. The cookware's charcoal-gray, nonstick exterior has an attractive enamel-like appearance. A kitchen workhorse, this 2-quart saucepan stands 4 inches high and measures 6-1/2 inches in diameter. It carries a lifetime warranty against defects and should be hand washed. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Za8NlZhkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anolon","source_asin":"B07FN3R6H3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FN3R6H3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FN3R6H3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":445451,"name":"Over the Sink Dish Drying Rack,17''L x 18.5''W Stainless Steel Foldable Roll-Up Multipurpose Dish Drainer for Kitchen Sink or Counter top (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71baReTBYTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"VaLaVie Food-Grade Roll Up Dish Drying Rack: MULTIPLE-FUNCTION, UNBEATABLE QUALITY, SOLID PERFORMANCE Are you tired of large dish drying racks that seem to fit nowhere in your kitchen? Are you desperate to get a dish drying rack that has multiple functions? Well, look no further, this Stainless Steel Roll Up Dish Drying Rack is exactly what you need Our dish drying rack is made of tough 304 stainless steel, it’s sturdy, durable and rust-resistant, providing a long-lasting performance that we’re proud of. All the stainless steel and silicone are food-grade, non-toxic, can be heat sterilized, and complies with the FDA. The rack can be placed atop your sink for drying dishes and defrosting foods, allowing the resulting water to drip right into the drain to prevent damaging your furniture or countertops. It can also hold wet vegetable and fruits temporary like a salad colander or vegetable washing bowl, and holding bread, cake to dry like a cooling rack Roll it up when you’re not using it, so you’ll be able to store it virtually anywhere – and it will take little space! Plus, the rack is wider than other models, measuring 16.9Wx18.5L inches, so it can comfortably accommodate more dishes and foods. Note: To avoid buying inappropriate size of this drainer rack, please measure the size of your sink before purchasing.Some of its most notable benefits include: Tough 304 stainless steel is sturdy, durable and rust-resistant Large size can accommodate more dishes and fruits than any competitor Dimensions : 17\"L x 18-1/2\"W x 3/8\"H (43 cm x 47 cm x 0.9 cm) Heat resistant, you can place hot pots over it! It can resist up to 450° F  Space saving and easy to store, roll it up when not in use Non-sticky and odorless. Made of food grade silicone and stainless steel Satisfaction Guarantee!!! CLICK the “Add to Cart” button to order now","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71baReTBYTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ValaVie","source_asin":"B01MDV3G0Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445451","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MDV3G0Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MDV3G0Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
