window.products.push({"id":445493,"name":"HITASION Pre-lit Artificial Christmas Tree 6ft Premium Hinged Dunhill Fir Includes Pre-Strung White Lights and Foldable Stand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VdiSnqQ-L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"LUSH FULL AND NATURAL APPEARANCE: Standing at 6 feet tall, 50 inches wide, this hinged Christmas tree will be an eye-catching centerpiece to any room during the holidays. The blades of this Christmas tree are made of ultra-realistic PVC, retain their shape and sport a deep forest green color that, making it look more real and full. PLENTY OF SPRUCE-STYLE BRANCHES: With 1,450 high classic branch tips to create the natural appearance of a full-bodied, genuine pine tree. NOTE: Please pay more patience to fluffy all tips straight and make it full, It will be more beautiful. Our dense and classic PVC Needles are Fire-resistant and Non-allergenic. 8 LIGHTING MODES PRE-STRUNG WHITE LIGHTS: With 450 warm white LED lights bring a festive glow to your home. And the lights features 8 flash modes, so you can create different atmospheres and effects as needed. This tree will last you for many holidays with its sturdy metal base and energy-efficient pre-strung LED lights that remain lit even if a bulb burns out. STURDY FOLDABLE METAL STAND: HITASION Christmas tree uses metal hinged body instead of cheap plastic stand. Folding metal base is durable, prevents breakage, provides stability, keeps your tree standing tall for all season. EASY ASSEMBLY AND DISASSEMBLY: Disassembles into 3 hinged sections to allow for easy assembling, dismantling, and storing. All metal hinged construction (branches are attached to center pole sections). Assembly and shaping instructions included. Let you easily place lights and ornaments, filling the room with Christmas cheer. Enjoy it season after season!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VdiSnqQ-L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HITASION","source_asin":"B08CVD3QZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445493","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CVD3QZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CVD3QZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":445494,"name":"TDZWIN 2 Pack Black Curtain Rods for Windows 48 to 84 Inch, 1 Inch Diameter Heavy Duty Black Curtain Rods, Matte Black Modern Telescoping Drapery Rods","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51grAcJf-tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【EASY TO ASSEMBLY & INSTALL】-- Get your installation tools and our matching hardware accessories ready, the installation will be easy and completely under your control. TDZWIN curtain rods come complete with everything you need to get set up, which include Pencil, Ruler, Manual, and Size Paper. If you have any question during installation, please feel free to contact us and we will help you to get an easy installation. 【STRONG WITH HIGH QUALITY MATERIAL】-- Heavy duty curtain rods and the brackets are made of strong iron. Our thickened curtain rods are very load-bearing, heavy duty cutrain rods measures 1 Inch diameter outer rod and 7/8\" inner rod, 50 mil strengthen metal rod thickness, holds up to 30 pounds, which is capable of holding heavier fabrics. 【MORE DURABLE WITH UPGRADED STRUCTURE】-- Instead of a whole easy bent long curtain rod, we designed a new updated structure with the segmented structure, which can greatly solve the problem of load-bearing bending, making the curtain rod stay straight during use. With the telescoping structure, this Curtain rod can extend easily from 40 to 76 inches, curtain rods are used in bedrooms, living rooms, kitchens, and outdoor patios, etc. 【SIMPLE & MODERN DESIGN】-- The end caps of the black curtain rod's simple and modern shape attract attention, enhance your home furnishing taste and grade creating a unique and artistic feeling, which can match well with various home styles such as industrial style, modern style, minimalist style, and etc. Ideal for use with light, medium weight, or heavy curtains max. 【CONSIDERATE AFTER-SALE SERVICE】-- Parts List: Central Rod X6, End Rod X4, Final X4, Bracket X6, Bushing X4, Splice X4, Screw X12, Anchor X12, and installation instructions. Your 2 pack black curtain rods for windows 40 to 76 come with the best after-sales service, which means if you have any issues with this product you could contact us for the black curtain rod solutions, we will give you the best shopping experience without any worries!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51grAcJf-tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TDZWIN","source_asin":"B0BD7BPX2X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445494","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD7BPX2X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD7BPX2X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
