window.products.push({"id":445504,"name":"Flora Bunda Purple Eggplant, Artificial Vegetable Fake Food","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ytgFKJckL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Soft firm body with rubber stem & leaves. Color variations and size make this very convincing! Measures about 6 in high and 3.25 in wide at the widest point. Dimples, flat spots and skin variations only help to make this vegetable look more real!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ytgFKJckL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flora Bunda","source_asin":"B00ISAA4MI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445504","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ISAA4MI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ISAA4MI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":445505,"name":"Ann Clark Cookie Cutters Oregon Cookie Cutter, 3.25\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51145A66dDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Family owned and operated since 1989, Ann Clark Cookie Cutters (The Cookie Cutter People from Vermont) has grown from a small gift company to the largest manufacturer of cookie cutters in America. Soon after its launch the company became a family affair. Very supportive from the outset, Ann's late husband John became Vice-President in 1996. That same year her late son, John Jr., served as a key player when he moved back to Vermont and daughter Elizabeth joined up as Sales Manager. She has since moved on to other endeavors. Ann's son Ben came on board in 1998 and is now the company's CEO. Grandchildren Margaret, Rebecca and Alistair can be seen in company catalogs and also lend their services as cookie makers, tasters, and decorators. Made in the USA is an important label to us. We pride ourselves on our ability to manufacture high quality competitively priced cookie cutters using American made materials and workers. Every cookie cutter is made using certified metal from United States Steel Corporation. Our manufacturing team enjoys a happy and healthy place to work and the folks answering our phones are sitting right here in Vermont. As a customer, you can count on quality products that are consistently available and ship right away. You will know you've purchased our American made cookie cutter by the \"Made in the USA\" label on every product. Thank you for choosing our American made cookie cutters. Our cookie cutters meet safety requirements under California's Proposition 65 for lead and cadmium, CPSIA for lead, Bureau Veritas country of origin marking, and FDA - GRAS for metal intended to come into contact with food.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51145A66dDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ann Clark Cookie Cutters","source_asin":"B00KJ8JO0U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KJ8JO0U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KJ8JO0U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":445506,"name":"SoloWilder Stove Ash Grate Replaceable Stainless Steel Wood Burning Stove Accessories with Pivot 10.2 * 6.7 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yBpRXzRDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Usage: The stove ash shelf separates the fuel from the inside of the tent hearth. This design increases the contact area of the wood with the air at the bottom, so that the wood at the bottom can burn more fully. Pivot Design: Add 5 pivots with a height of 1 cm. The support angle can make the furnace ash separator not directly touch the furnace. Unique Craftsmanship: The process of the surrounding legs is stamping technology, and the center leg is welding technology. Make the corners more stable and firm. Easy to Clean: Unlike iron racks, stainless steel is easier to clean than iron and less prone to sticking to oil. Rounded Edge: The edge of the ash separator is smooth and rounded, and there is no hard right-angled edge to hurt the hand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yBpRXzRDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SoloWilder","source_asin":"B09XM72916","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445506","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XM72916","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XM72916","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":445507,"name":"Marinex 4-Piece Rectangular Bake Dish Set, 1.7 QRT. & 2.3 QRT, Assorted","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DVXc0yVDL._AC_.jpg","description":"Marinex Glass Bakeware production began over 50 years ago by Santa Marina, the largest glass manufacturer in Latin America. Located in Brazil, Santa Marina has been producing different glass products since 1895. The factory location is close to raw material deposits of boron and sand which is rich in color and quality. During the production process, these raw materials are combined using heat to make borosilicate glass. Borosilicate glass is resistant to changes in temperatures used in cooking and baking. The raw materials also give Marinex glass bakeware a slight bluish tint consistant throughout all pieces. Marinex Glass Bakeware offers several shapes and sizes that have countless uses in culinary activities and are prominent by their beauty, durability, and ease of cleaning. It can be used to prepare, bake, and serve food as well as to freeze prepared food. It is safe for both conventional ovens and microwave ovens. Marinex Bakeware can go from the freezer/refrigerator to a pre-heated oven where the oven temperature does not exceed 100C or 212F to start. However, Marinex Bakeware should not be used on stovetop burners or over a direct flame. This is a 2pc. set of rectangular baking dishes that includes a small 1.7qt. rectangular baking dish(11-5/8\" x 7\" x 2\") with a plastic lid and a medium 2.3qt. rectangular baking dish(13-5/8\" x 8-1/8\" x 2\") with a plastic lid. Plastic lids vary in color from red, green, yellow, purple, blue, and clear. All Marinex bakeware is dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DVXc0yVDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marinex","source_asin":"B0016MXL2U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0016MXL2U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0016MXL2U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
