window.products.push({"id":445656,"name":"Signature Housewares Now & Then 12-Ounce Utility Stem, Mint, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mZdc164MS._AC_SL1302_.jpg","description":"Product Description Signature's Now & Then Set of Four 12-Ounce Utility Glasses in mint are perfect for both water and wine. These beautifully etched glasses are dishwasher safe, so you can use them everyday! A perfect way to dress up your table, these utility glasses are well made and a great addition to your stemware collection. Matching dinnerware pieces also available. This glass can also be purchased as a 8-ounce glass, as well as in clear, rose blossum and chiffon - try them out today! Amazon.com These Now & Then glass goblets from Signature Housewares are sturdy in form, with ball-style stems that feel very comfortable to hold and squared bowls that feature delicately etched swags and bead designs. The goblets are even tinted in shades that match Now & Then dinnerware: a choice of entirely clear or with a pink, mint, or yellow tint on the base, stem, and lower portion of the bowl. Dishwasher-safe and perfect for wine or water, the four 12-ounce goblets in the set make an excellent gift and may be mixed and matched with goblets of different colors in the smaller eight-ounce size. Now & Then dinnerware is characterized by pastel colors and prettily scalloped edges. The collection includes place settings, serving accessories such as a teapot and cake stand, and etched glass goblets tinted to match. Vintage shades of pink, mint, yellow, turquoise, and linen, even a floral accent plate, allow for unlimited mix-and-match possibilities for everyday use or life's special occasions. Most of the pieces are made of durable stoneware that is safe for use in the microwave and dishwasher. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mZdc164MS._AC_SL1302_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Signature Housewares","source_asin":"B000OFT7Q4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445656","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000OFT7Q4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000OFT7Q4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":445657,"name":"StoreSMART Magnetic Rigid Frames - 8 1/2\" x 11\" - 10-Pack - Refrigerator/Locker - Top Loaders - HPP812X11M-10","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31qIO8nN8fL._AC_.jpg","description":"StoreSMART's Magnetic Rigid Print Protectors give your posters and photos the protection they deserve! Each rigid-edged protector is crafted of clear, \"non-migrating\" PVC vinyl that contains no plasticizers or stearates, which means they won't harm your beloved collectibles or important work documents. With two strong magnetic strips on back - display your photos on any magnetic surface! Help your favorite prints retain their value while they're being displayed or stored--and protect them from everyday disasters such as dust, water, and exuberant children--by pulling them out of their envelopes and paper tubes and sliding them into one of our professional print protectors. Protect workplace safety posters from staining and fading. Or join hundreds of successful restaurants by using our protectors to house menus. No matter how you choose to make use of them, your important materials will be safe and sound. Looking for this product without magnets? Check out our Rigid Print Protectors (HPP812X11). Product Features: Made of clear, high-impact 16 mil PVC vinyl with a 40 mil opening. Overall size: 9 1/16\" x 11 1/4\". Inside capacity: 8 1/2\" x 11\" Open on the short side. Has two strong 1/2\" x 11\" magnetic strips on the back. Rigid for ultimate protection. Reusable. Proudly sold by an American woman-owned company. Suggestions for Use: Art lovers: Our rigid protectors make preservation and display a breeze. Enjoy your art, while protecting it from the elements! Businesses: Use our rigid protectors to create visual management displays, label doors, drawers, and filing cabinets, and to post vital information (such as safety posters) where employees can see it. Teachers: Use them to display children's artwork, or to protect educational prints as you display or use them within the classroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31qIO8nN8fL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STORE SMART","source_asin":"B07YF3H9VN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445657","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YF3H9VN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YF3H9VN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
