window.products.push({"id":445815,"name":"Slice Solutions 11-by-7-Inch Precut Brownie Pan Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ddN2XQ0OL._AC_.jpg","description":"If you love baking then you know of the many problems that tend to occur during the process. Problem 1: Slicing Brownies while in the pan is messy, the top crust tends to break apart and its difficult to cut along the edges. Slice Solutions has created a sectioner that is sized perfectly for the pan that you place into the batter before cooking. One cooked and cooled the sectioner is removed and you have 18 presliced, perfectly sized, brownies! Problem 2: Removing the brownie slices from the pan is not easy, even with a small turner you tend to crush at least the first one or two brownies just to get into the pan. Slice Solutions has developed a pan with a removable bottom that eliminates this issue. After removing the sectioner you place the entire pan, centered, on the included wire lifting platform. In doing so, the removable bottom stays on the rack and the outer pan drops underneath allowing for you to easily use a small turner to remove the brownies! In addition to using the pan for brownies you can use it to make crumb cake, corn bread, and other baked goods!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ddN2XQ0OL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Slice Solutions","source_asin":"B00186YXJO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445815","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00186YXJO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00186YXJO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":445816,"name":"JIC Gem B Grade Ammonite Fossil Stone 4-4.5\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eeT08Q8rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is (1) a beautiful polished finish, uncut, Ammonite solid stone. This unique piece comes from Madagascar and is a great choice for beading, jewelry making, general arts and craft, and soul channeling. The colors are brilliant and have a glimmer effect when held under light. Ammonites are excellent index fossils. Their fossil shells usually take the form of planispirals, although there were some helically spiraled and non-spiraled forms. The name \"Ammonite\", from which the scientific term is derived, was inspired by the spiral shape of their fossilized shells, which somewhat resemble tightly coiled rams' horns. Pliny the Elder (d. 79 AD near Pompeii) called fossils of these animals ammonis cornua (\"horns of Ammon\") because the Egyptian god Ammon (Amun) was typically depicted wearing ram's horns. Often the name of an ammonite genus ends in -ceras, which is Greek for \"horn\". In medieval Europe, fossilized Ammonites were thought to be petrified coiled snakes, and were called \"snakestones\" or, more commonly in medieval England, \"serpentstones\". Ammonites were prolific breeders, lived in schools, and are among the most abundant fossils found today, although they went extinct with the dinosaurs 65 million years ago. In healing; Ammonite will assist with general good health and promotes high energy. It can help transmute negativity to smooth flowing energy. Ammonites have a strong positive Earth energy to it, and are?used in finding the ¡°spiritual spiral path¡± to the center where the God and Goddess await. It can also assist during childbirth and will be helpful for general survival skills. Ammonite can help release karmic debris and harmful thought patterns, while helping to attain and enhance personal power within the Self.??This fossil is also helpful in releasing depression and finding purpose.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eeT08Q8rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JIC Gem","source_asin":"B00W4QGUAW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00W4QGUAW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00W4QGUAW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
