window.products.push({"id":445917,"name":"Set of Three Hand Blown Glass Wall Vases","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NhE4v66xL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"These hand blown glass wall vases stand about 6\" tall and are 1.75\" diameter. Each vase has a hole in the back for hanging and will arrive with a nail - you just need to provide a hammer. We will also include simple directions for hanging to the best effect. Beautiful alone with a single flower stem or dramatic in groups - perhaps with a different flower in each? Please note, as each vase is handmade, length of vases may vary slightly. I ship worldwide, so please contact me if you need mailing costs outside of the US.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NhE4v66xL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gift Galleryz Glass","source_asin":"B00F1OIS5O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445917","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00F1OIS5O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00F1OIS5O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":445918,"name":"K45WW Wire Whip Attachment for KitchenAid Tilt-Head Stand Mixer, Stainless Steel, Egg Heavy Cream Beater, Cakes Mayonnaise","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.93,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ir8ilWfIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Applications: K45WW 6-Wire Whip whisk Attachment is designed to fit kitchen aide 4.5-5QT title-head stand mixers. It mixtures that need air incorporated, e.g., Egg Cream Stirrer, Heavy Cream Beater, Cakes Mayonnaise Whisk, Flour Cake Balloon Whisk. It is a must-have for home cooks and restaurant chefs. Material: Premium 304 stainless steel, rustproof, corrosion-resistant, sanitary, sturdy, heavy-duty, wear-resistant, smooth edges, not damage your kitchenware. No worry about coating crack and chip off. Dishwasher safe Package includes: 1 x Wire Whip How To Attach Wire Whip: 1. Turn speed control to OFF. 2. Unplug Stand Mixer or disconnect power. 3. Tilt motor head back. 4. Slip beater onto beater shaft and press upward as far as possible. 5. Turn beater to right, hooking beater over pin on shaft. 6. Plug into a grounded 3 prong outlet. How To Remove Wire Whip 1. Turn speed control to OFF. 2. Unplug Stand Mixer or disconnect power. 3. Tilt motor head back. 4. Press beater upward as far as possible and turn left. 5. Pull beater from beater shaft. How to correct the clearance from the bowl 1. Turn speed control to OFF. 2. Unplug Stand Mixer or disconnect power. 3. Tilt motor head back. 4. Turn beater height adjustment screw SLIGHTLY counterclockwise (left) to raise the Wire Whip or clockwise (right) to lower the Wire Whip. 5. Make adjustment so that the Wire Whip just clears the surface of the bowl.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ir8ilWfIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"niceSpring","source_asin":"B09R3PVGCY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445918","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09R3PVGCY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09R3PVGCY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":445919,"name":"Riedel Vinum Extreme Cocktail/Martini Glass, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31K8J6PST9L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description A bit of a detour from the classic martini-style glasses, these Riedel Vinum Extreme cocktail glasses feature a generous bowl, in a V-shape, yet the lip curves in at the top, giving the design a rather sexy shape. Classy and elegant, these Extreme glasses are designed with a diamond-shaped silhouette, distinguishing this collection with a more modern look and generous bowl size. Packed in a set of 2, the glasses stand 6-7/8 inches tall, with a full capacity of 8-3/4 ounces. Amazon.com Differing from the classic inverted cone of most martini glasses, this one features a slight curve at the rim that echoes the modern diamond shape of Riedel's Vinum Extreme line. Beautifully balanced and with just the right mixture of delicacy and stability, the seven-inch-tall, generously sized glass holds up to 8-3/4 ounces of any cocktail or martini. This set of two makes a handsome wedding gift or adds to an existing collection for the home bartender. Riedel developed the Vinum Extreme line to meet the demand of today's increasingly more concentrated wines. Though produced in Bavaria of more than 24 percent lead crystal, which lends superb brilliance and clarity, Vinum Extreme glasses are affordable because they are machine-made rather than mouth-blown. While dishwasher-safe, Vinum Extreme crystal is best washed by hand to prevent detergent residue that can affect wine taste. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31K8J6PST9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Riedel","source_asin":"B016XQWK8E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-445919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016XQWK8E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016XQWK8E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
